[
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_expose>",
    "//": "スペルから呼び出されるのでモンスターがBeta",
    "text": [
      "<npc_name>脱光衣服，开始向周围展示香艳的肉体！",
      "<npc_name>一边展示自己的一切，一边用甜美的声音邀诱惑大家！",
      "<npc_name>把手放在腿间，开始发出欲求不满的声音！"
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_movingdoing>",
    "text": [
      "*啪滋啪滋*",
      "哈啊——哈啊——",
      "唔嗯♪",
      "唔呼呼♪",
      "喵喵♪"
    ]
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet", 
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_query_myself>",
    "text": "对自己使用吗？"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_query_npc>",
    "text": "和<npc_name>一起快乐？"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_query_monster>",
    "text": "和<npc_name>一起快乐？"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_great_success_with_love>",
    "text": "<npc_name>非常兴奋地答应了。"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_query_no_dev>",
    "text": "<npc_name>似乎想要不带套做爱，接受吗？"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_great_success_with_fear>",
    "text": "<npc_name>因为对你强烈的恐惧感而完全服从..."
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_success_with_love>",
    "text": "<npc_name>有些害羞地红着脸答应了你。"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_success_with_fear>",
    "text": "<npc_name>因为对你有强烈的恐惧感而无法拒绝..."
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_fail>",
    "text": "被委婉地拒绝了。"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_yiff_great_fail>",
    "text": "被激烈地拒绝了。"
  },
  {
    "type": "snippet",
    "category": "<hentai_play_with_finish>",
    "text": "*舒服的事情*结束了。"
  },
